        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bono\n- Organizations: U2\n- Events: U2 360° Tour, Lungs Tour\n- Products: \"Electrical Storm\"\n- Concepts: in-the-round concert staging\n\nFacts:\n- U2 is a rock band, and Bono is its lead vocalist and primary lyricist.\n- The U2 360° Tour was a worldwide concert tour by U2.\n- The U2 360° Tour featured in-the-round concerts on a circular stage that allowed the audience to surround U2 on all sides.\n- U2 did not perform \"Electrical Storm\" live until 2 July 2009, when the band played it at the second Barcelona concert of the U2 360° Tour.\n- In 2011, they also supported U2 on the U2 360° Tour.",
